    "value": "The fundamental theorem of statistical learning. For a measurable concept class, finite VC dimension, eventually polynomial growth, and PAC learnability are mutually equivalent."
  },
  {
    "field": "claim.decl_name",
    "value": "vcDim_fundamental_theorem"
  },
  {
    "field": "claim.pretty",
    "value": "∀ {X : Type u} [inst : MeasurableSpace X] [MeasurableSingletonClass X] (C : ConceptClass X Bool)\n  [MeasurableConceptClass X C],\n  (VCDim X C < ⊤ ↔ PACLearnable X C) ∧\n    (VCDim X C < ⊤ ↔ ∃ K d, ∀ᶠ (m : ℕ) in Filter.atTop, ↑(GrowthFunction X C m) ≤ K * ↑m ^ d)"
  },
